# ─── MIMIC marketing site — build-time configuration ───────────────────────
# Both values below are PUBLIC. They are compiled into the client bundle, so
# nothing secret can go in this file. This site holds no keys of any kind: the
# only backend it talks to is one public, unauthenticated lead-capture route.

# The web application, for the "Sign in" links. This site has no /login of its
# own, so the links leave for the app. REQUIRED for a production build —
# vite.config.ts fails the build without it rather than shipping dead links.
VITE_APP_ORIGIN=https://app.talbotiq.com

# The backend origin. The demo form posts to ${VITE_API_BASE}/api/web/leads.
# Leave blank for local development: the dev server proxies /api/web itself.
VITE_API_BASE=https://inteview-backend-14029160874.asia-south1.run.app
